WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,000
Can be worry-free for a while

2
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:02,900
But if you marry a man

3
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:05,300
To serve the parents-in-law and husband

4
00:00:05,600 --> 00:00:06,500
How tiring

5
00:00:07,230 --> 00:00:09,230
Is my life now happy and sweet?

6
00:00:09,530 --> 00:00:11,430
We've known each other not long ago

7
00:00:11,730 --> 00:00:14,430
We still don’t understand each other very well, so

8
00:00:14,530 --> 00:00:15,730
I can't promise you this

9
00:00:16,030 --> 00:00:17,030
Let’s talk about it in the future, okay?

10
00:00:17,230 --> 00:00:18,630
You already know me very well

11
00:00:19,230 --> 00:00:20,830
Didn't you know about my situation?

12
00:00:21,030 --> 00:00:22,230
I told you last time

13
00:00:22,230 --> 00:00:23,430
I haven't had a boyfriend either

14
00:00:23,430 --> 00:00:24,430
No experience in love

15
00:00:24,530 --> 00:00:26,130
I don't understand you as a person

16
00:00:26,430 --> 00:00:27,730
I don’t know your character

17
00:00:28,290 --> 00:00:29,690
For example, will you be jealous?

18
00:00:30,420 --> 00:00:32,520
For example, do you have a strong desire to control?

19
00:00:32,720 --> 00:00:34,020
I don't like jealous people

20
00:00:34,320 --> 00:00:35,820
I don’t have a strong desire to control either.

21
00:00:37,010 --> 00:00:39,220
you are human

22
00:00:39,520 --> 00:00:42,420
How could he not be jealous if he became his boyfriend?

23
00:00:43,150 --> 00:00:44,750
Do you want to control my wealth?

24
00:00:45,770 --> 00:00:47,570
I don’t want to talk to my girlfriend so early
